{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "08c09801-44d0-8159-945a-00e2a3e9d586",
  "created_at": "2026-03-09T13:55:48-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Yusuf Okafor",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:52:25-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. Good afternoon, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:52:31-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, good afternoon. My name is Yusuf Okafor. I call about a road problem. The edge of road is crumbling."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:52:40-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Mr. Okafor, I can take that down. Can you tell me where the road is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:52:48-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is at 59 Carroll Avenue. In front of my building, near the curve."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:52:55-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "59 Carroll Avenue, got it. And you said the edge of the road is crumbling. Is it right at the curve?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:53:05-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, at the curve. The asphalt at the edge break apart, small pieces and some big pieces. [pause] It is right in the bike lane."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:53:16-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "In the bike lane, okay. So somebody riding a bike could hit it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:53:22-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly. A bicycle come around the curve, they have to go out to the car side to avoid. I think is not safe."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:53:33-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That makes sense. Did this start recently, or has it been like that a while?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:53:40-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It was little bit before. But after the rain from Friday into Saturday, two days ago, it is more bad. More pieces gone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:53:50-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, the wet weather does that to the edges. How big an area would you say? Like a few feet along the edge?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:54:00-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Maybe, um, [pause] maybe six feet long. And the width, about one foot into the lane."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:54:08-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Six feet long, about a foot wide into the bike lane, at the curve by 59 Carroll. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:54:18-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, correct. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:54:21-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. I'll put that in as a road repair request for the crew to look at. Can I get a phone number in case they have a question?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:54:34-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is 401-555-0195."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:54:37-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0195. And that's for Yusuf Okafor, O-K-A-F-O-R?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:54:41-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is right. Sorry, I am on speakerphone, because my hand is busy. I am packing my old laptop to trade in. Only small credit, but okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:54:54-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, no problem, I can hear you fine. Let me just finish this entry here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:55:01-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:55:04-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, it's in. Anything else about that spot you want the crew to know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:55:11-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I think that is all. Can I have a reference number, please? For follow up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:55:19-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Have a pen? It's R-W, then 4-4-0-7-1. I'll say it again, R-W, 4-4-0-7-1."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:55:26-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "R-W, four, four, zero, seven, one. Okay, I write it. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:55:32-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. If you call back, give them that number and they can pull it up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:55:40-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Thank you very much, Miss Lorraine. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:55:45-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Mr. Okafor. Bye now."
    }
  ],
